    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f8/Shieldaly_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230428120440\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Shieldaly Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f8/Shieldaly_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230428120440\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"900\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Shieldaly Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Shieldaly_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>玫瑰荆棘骑士</b>\n</p><p>一位在地方城市担任护卫的美丽战士。她的巨盾如玫瑰之刺，弹开敌人的攻击。轻量化的铠甲设计旨在持盾时保持身法轻盈，似乎是护卫的传统装备。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8a/Shieldaly_spc_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230428120554\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Shieldaly spc Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8a/Shieldaly_spc_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230428120554\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"812\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Shieldaly spc Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Shieldaly_spc_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260819182432\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighe